Atmospheric Sounds — third-party notices and provenance
=======================================================

Atmospheric Sounds is an unofficial Luanti port based on the Minecraft mod
AmbientSounds by CreativeMD and its contributors. At the matching upstream
reference below, the Fabric metadata lists CreativeMD and AriaFreeze as authors
and declares LGPL-3.0-only; see the actual upstream metadata and license:

https://github.com/CreativeMD/AmbientSounds/blob/e4c8c2df10b51733652b5ac612fb9bd2f72c2326/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json
https://github.com/CreativeMD/AmbientSounds/blob/e4c8c2df10b51733652b5ac612fb9bd2f72c2326/LICENSE

Upstream attribution applies to the original project and its material used or
adapted by this port, including renamed sounds and any adapted code or data.
The Lua port and its original contributions are credited to NeoSparkServers.
The upstream Minecraft source tree is not bundled; it served as a reference.

All 120 distributed OGG sound files map one-to-one to files in that upstream
reference. All 120 files in the port's initial import match those upstream
files byte-for-byte (SHA-256). The distributed files have since been renamed
and re-encoded; three source files were also resampled. This reference revision
is a verified matching comparison point, not a claim about the exact checkout
originally used to develop the port. See SOUND_PROVENANCE.md for every filename,
the exact source paths, and limitations of the verification.

The checked upstream metadata declares LGPL-3.0-only for the project. No
separate per-sound copyright notices or an explicit project copyright notice
were found in the checked upstream tree. The Free Software Foundation notice in
the license text concerns that text, not authorship of the sound recordings.
The mapping above does not establish who originally recorded each sound or
independently verify any earlier third-party rights. No invented per-sound
copyright notices or claims of exclusive authorship are made here.

Original artwork: `icon.png` and `icon/Atmospheric soundsL.png` were created
by NeoSparkServers and are licensed under LGPL-3.0-only. The two files are
byte-identical.

License texts: LICENSES/LGPL-3.0.txt and LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt; see LICENSE for
